Prompt chaining vs. one big prompt
One Big Prompt	Prompt Chaining
Simpler to write	More modular
Faster for simple tasks	Better for complex tasks
Harder to debug	Easy to inspect each step
More likely to mix tasks	Each prompt has one responsibility




